## File Location

Widgets live in `resources/` directory:

```
my-server/
├── index.ts              # Server code
├── resources/
│   ├── weather-display.tsx    # Widget component
│   ├── product-list.tsx
│   └── calendar-view.tsx
└── package.json
```

**Naming convention:**

- Use kebab-case for widget names
- Tool config: `widget: { name: "weather-display" }`
- File: `resources/weather-display.tsx`

